  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     alchemy_bench
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> Reduction Base (x1), Glass Vial (x1), Unmaking Distillate (x1),
               First-Bloom Nectar (x1), Blood-moss (x6), Salt Pouch (x4)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Learned:</ansi>     by commission from Veyra (not self-taught)

